<symbol type="1" id="151" code="526" name="Cairn, memorial, small monument or boundary stone"><description>Cairn, memorial, small monument or boundary stone that is obvious.
Large massive monuments shall be represented in plan shape with the symbol Building (521).
Footprint: 4 m in diameter.</description><point_symbol inner_radius="350" inner_color="-1" outer_width="275" outer_color="2" elements="1"><element><symbol type="1" code=""><point_symbol inner_radius="125" inner_color="2" outer_width="0" outer_color="-1" elements="0"/></symbol><object type="0"><coords count="1">0 0;</coords></object></element></point_symbol></symbol>
